                                            <TextBlock Text="1. 查程序在哪 (类似 which):" FontSize="11" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#475569"/>
                                            <TextBox Text="where python" IsReadOnly="True" Background="#F8FAFC" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="11" Margin="0,2,0,6"/>

                                            <TextBlock Text="2. Windows 最强多线程断点镜像复制 (秒杀 copy):" FontSize="11" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#475569"/>
                                            <TextBox Text="robocopy C:\Src D:\Dst /E /MT:16 /R:1 /W:1" IsReadOnly="True" Background="#F8FAFC" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="11" Margin="0,2,0,6"/>

                                            <TextBlock Text="3. 将任何命令输出直接注入系统剪贴板:" FontSize="11" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#475569"/>
                                            <TextBox Text="ipconfig /all | clip" IsReadOnly="True" Background="#F8FAFC" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="11" Margin="0,2,0,6"/>

                                            <TextBlock Text="4. 强制强杀进程 (按映像名或 PID):" FontSize="11" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#475569"/>
                                            <TextBox Text="taskkill /f /im node.exe" IsReadOnly="True" Background="#F8FAFC" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="11" Margin="0,2,0,6"/>

                                            <TextBlock Text="5. 切换控制台 UTF-8 编码 (防乱码):" FontSize="11" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#475569"/>
                                            <TextBox Text="chcp 65001" IsReadOnly="True" Background="#F8FAFC" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="11" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Border>

                                    <!-- PowerShell 神技 -->
                                    <Border Grid.Column="1" Background="White" BorderBrush="#E2E8F0" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="6" Padding="12" Margin="8,0,0,0">
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Text="🟦 现代 PowerShell 对象级生产力神技" FontWeight="Bold" FontSize="13" Foreground="#0284C7" Margin="0,0,0,8"/>

                                            <TextBlock Text="1. 原生测试远程 TCP 端口通不通 (替代 telnet):" FontSize="11" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#475569"/>
                                            <TextBox Text="Test-NetConnection github.com -Port 443" IsReadOnly="True" Background="#F8FAFC" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="11" Margin="0,2,0,6"/>

                                            <TextBlock Text="2. 对象管道筛选 (找出前 5 个最吃内存的进程):" FontSize="11" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#475569"/>
                                            <TextBox Text="Get-Process | Sort-Object WorkingSet64 -Desc | Select -First 5" IsReadOnly="True" Background="#F8FAFC" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="11" Margin="0,2,0,6"/>

                                            <TextBlock Text="3. 查看并格式化拆分环境变量 PATH:" FontSize="11" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#475569"/>
                                            <TextBox Text="$env:PATH -split ';'" IsReadOnly="True" Background="#F8FAFC" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="11" Margin="0,2,0,6"/>

                                            <TextBlock Text="4. 计算文件 SHA256 哈希值 (防篡改校验):" FontSize="11" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#475569"/>
                                            <TextBox Text="Get-FileHash ./target.iso -Algorithm SHA256" IsReadOnly="True" Background="#F8FAFC" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="11" Margin="0,2,0,6"/>

                                            <TextBlock Text="5. 现代网络一键执行脚本 (安全安装环境):" FontSize="11" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#475569"/>
                                            <TextBox Text="irm https://get.scoop.sh | iex" IsReadOnly="True" Background="#F8FAFC" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="11" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Border>
